@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Full portfolio content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio

### Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### One project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/sentinel

### Skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills

### Experience
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experience

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Contact (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya Recruiter",
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "company": "Example Corp",
  "message": "Hi Nandhini, I would like to talk about a senior engineer role."
}

### Contact (invalid: returns 400 with field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "message": "short"
}
